The libdiag name seems well-known on the internet even if it is not an
opensource project. We take that opportunity use the `libdiag1` binary package
name to match the soname of the libdiag library.

Possible conflicts while inspecting codesearch.debian.org shows that the
`diagnostics` [1] source package creates a `libdiagnostics0t64` package, but is
not likely to interfere with the `libdiag1` name.

[1] https://tracker.debian.org/pkg/diagnostics
